<title>USA: Healthcare Realty completes 4.5 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Healthcare Realty completes 4.5 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthcare Realty Trust Inc said Thursday it completed a $122 million equity offering, pricing 4.5 million shares of common stock priced at $27.25 a share.</p>
<p>The company said the stock was sold to underwriters led by Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp and including A G Edwards &amp; Sons Inc, Equitable Securities Corp, Lehman Bros and Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the underwriting team has a 30-day option to buy up to 675,000 more shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
